        3253
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, administrative reorganization measures have demonstrated that the municipal government can more efficiently and economically direct and coordinate all aspects of emergency planning as a staff function of the Emergency Control Board-Office of Civil Defense,",
